abstract: >-
  ReEKF-SORT is a motion-only online multi-object tracker for occlusion and
  ambiguous motion-only association. It keeps the SORT-style
  tracking-by-detection workflow, uses a speed-angle extended Kalman filter, and
  adds causal pseudo-observation regularization plus confidence-continuity
  association.

title: "Online Multi-Object Tracking with Causal Pseudo-Observation Regularization and Confidence-Continuity Association"
